The issue is:
1. `_onInputBlur` uses `sto` (setTimeout) with 100ms delay to hide the picker
2. During this 100ms, the picker is still visible and can receive focus
3. When Tab is pressed, focus moves to #guests, but then the blur handler's timeout fires and hides the picker, and somehow focus returns to #checkin

The fix should:
1. Remove the setTimeout in _onInputBlur so it hides immediately (unless _c flag is set)
2. The _c flag is set to true in _onMouseDown when clicking on picker buttons (pika-select elements)
3. Also fix _onInputFocus to clear any pending timeout (though currently it doesn't set one, but the previous code used `sto.clear` which doesn't exist)

