It doesn't clear any timeout. The previous attempt tried to use `sto.clear(self._b)` but `sto` is just `window.setTimeout`, not an object with a clear method. Should use `clearTimeout(self._b)`.

But wait - the current code doesn't even store the timeout ID in _onInputFocus. The timeout is stored in `self._b` in _onInputBlur. So _onInputFocus should clear `self._b` if it exists.

